    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8217" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">circumjectĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		circumicio. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A throwing around</i>, <i>casting
				about</i> (postclass.) manuum, Cael. Aur Acut. 1, 2, 31.
			—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A putting on clothing</i>, <i>dressing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Arn. 2</span></i>
			, p 73</div>
